        "original_id": "994e6d8d-7872-52f5-a036-03f091972e45",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Friends in Low Places\", \"Mr. Blue\", \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\"\n- Albums: \"No Fences\"\n- People: Garth Brooks, Dewayne Blackwell, David Frizzell\n- Groups: The Fleetwoods\n- Charts: Billboard Top Country Albums\n\nFacts:\n- \"Mr. Blue\" was a 1959 hit for the Fleetwoods.\n- \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\" was a 1982 hit for David Frizzell.\n- \"Friends in Low Places\" is a song performed by American country pop artist Garth Brooks.\n- \"Friends in Low Places\" was released on August 6, 1990 as the lead single from the album \"No Fences\".\n- \"Friends in Low Places\" was a 1990 hit for Garth Brooks.\n- The album \"No Fences\" was released on August 27, 1990.\n- The album \"No Fences\" reached #1 on Billboard's Top Country Albums chart.\n- Dewayne Blackwell's songs include \"Mr. Blue,\" \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home,\" and \"Friends in Low Places\".",
